SAFETY-family finish reasons and a blocked prompt (promptFeedback with no
candidate) finish as content_filter instead of stop or no terminal event.
Upstream PR to be opened; remove when released.

A stream with no finish reason ends in a RUN_ERROR (code
incomplete-stream) instead of no terminal event, and the chat stream's
RUN_ERROR carries the latest usageMetadata the stream reported.
Upstream PR to be opened; remove when released.

